      {
        "id": 4233611958,
        "node_id": "PR_kwDOQ6ulRs78V8q2",
        "number": 259,
        "state": "closed",
        "title": "fix(ui): propagate StreamEnd finish_reason to UI finish event",
        "body": "## What\n\nThe AI SDK UI `finish` event always carries `finishReason: \"stop\"`, regardless of why the model actually stopped: `_StreamState` discarded `StreamEnd.finish_reason` and `finish()` hardcoded `\"stop\"`.\n\n## Why\n\nFrontends built on `useChat`/the AI SDK UI message stream branch on `finishReason` — surfacing truncation (`length`), content-filter stops, or recognizing that a turn ended because tools were called (`tool-calls`). With the hardcoded value every run looks like a clean text stop, which breaks that logic.\n\n## How\n\n- Capture `StreamEnd.finish_reason` in `_StreamState`\n- Map the internal OpenTelemetry-style vocabulary (`content_filter`, `tool_call`) to the UI wire values (`content-filter`, `tool-calls`); unknown values → `other`, missing → `stop` (preserving current behavior)\n\n## Tests\n\nAdded coverage for: default `stop`, `stop` passthrough, `content_filter` → `content-filter`, `tool_call` → `tool-calls`, `length`/`error` passthrough, and unknown → `other`. Full local gate green: ruff format/check, mypy, ty, 692 pytest tests, check-examples.",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/vercel-labs/ai-python/pull/259",
        "created_at": "2026-08-08T07:15:52Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-08-18T07:16:24Z",
        "closed_at": "2026-08-18T07:16:24Z",
        "merged_at": "2026-08-18T07:16:24Z",
        "merge_commit_sha": "e68868cbcf042391180e407720b823d63fb33e1f",
        "draft": false,
        "user": {
          "id": 146335736,
          "node_id": "U_kgDOCLjn-A",
          "login": "jaygupta17",
          "type": "User",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/jaygupta17"
        },
        "head": {
          "sha": "0d5fb1678a0d0b6d8219e5a38a8a4aa16f7a8345",
          "ref": "fix/ui-stream-finish-reason"
        },
        "base": {
          "sha": "1d7220a73b094c2680404cc39f679f442032d58c",
          "ref": "main"
        }
